    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inkborn is a <strong>roguelike deckbuilder</strong> where chaining cards into powerful combos is key to defeating your enemies. Explore a non-linear origami world where every run offers new ways to face otherworldly creatures. Prepare in the Town, which you can expand over time, unlock new cards and abilities, and customize your playstyle through a deep Skill Tree. Get ready to uncover the history behind a world of ink and paper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBOS</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/17a67281805945d43dde9b8b9f83baaf.poster.avif?t=1753739550\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/17a67281805945d43dde9b8b9f83baaf.webm?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/17a67281805945d43dde9b8b9f83baaf.mp4?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play cards in a specific sequence based on their type, represented by different symbols - Glyphs - under the card cost, to trigger special effects. Now, every draw holds the chance to unleash a powerful combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SKILL TREE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/430b69b4d92ce90faa20efc8e71526da.poster.avif?t=1753739550\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/430b69b4d92ce90faa20efc8e71526da.webm?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/430b69b4d92ce90faa20efc8e71526da.mp4?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gain Skill Points after your runs and use them to build your Skill Tree. Unlock various abilities based on your choice. Rebuild your Skill Tree and try different strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UPGRADEABLE HUB</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/c568ba5edd30707507e0eebecf8ddbe9.poster.avif?t=1753739550\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/c568ba5edd30707507e0eebecf8ddbe9.webm?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/c568ba5edd30707507e0eebecf8ddbe9.mp4?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Visit your Town between expeditions to prepare. Upgrade buildings to make your preparations more effective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROCEDURAL MAP</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/fb76289fa688ef7354107a346e0bcf60.poster.avif?t=1753739550\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/fb76289fa688ef7354107a346e0bcf60.webm?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/fb76289fa688ef7354107a346e0bcf60.mp4?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore a procedurally generated map and uncover paths through the fog of war. Shape your journey toward the act\u2019s final encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL VERSION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 250 cards to uncover progressively</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 100 powerful combos to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ events full of various unpredictable encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class with 30+ perks on the Skill Tree customizable before any run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 quotes to power up your journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MADE WITH PASSION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of creatures of ink, paper, and metal, each with clever mechanics to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game co-developed with award-winning board game designer Jamey Stegmaier, the mastermind behind Scythe, Charterstone, and Viticulture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive hand-crafted origami world, where mysterious creatures lurk, brought to life by an unknown force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made for the roguelike deckbuilder obsessives chasing the perfect flow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Early Access and contribute to shaping a great game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/e656c4fb546bb61e33bd18c21a77a995.avif?t=1753739550\" data-has-big width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Inkborn Acram Digital is co-financed by the European Funds for Smart Economy 2021\u20132027 under the KPT ScaleUp Booster project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inkborn is a <strong>roguelike deckbuilder</strong> where chaining cards into powerful combos is key to defeating your enemies. Explore a non-linear origami world where every run offers new ways to face otherworldly creatures. Prepare in the Town, which you can expand over time, unlock new cards and abilities, and customize your playstyle through a deep Skill Tree. Get ready to uncover the history behind a world of ink and paper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBOS</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/17a67281805945d43dde9b8b9f83baaf.poster.avif?t=1753739550\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/17a67281805945d43dde9b8b9f83baaf.webm?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/17a67281805945d43dde9b8b9f83baaf.mp4?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play cards in a specific sequence based on their type, represented by different symbols - Glyphs - under the card cost, to trigger special effects. Now, every draw holds the chance to unleash a powerful combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SKILL TREE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/430b69b4d92ce90faa20efc8e71526da.poster.avif?t=1753739550\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/430b69b4d92ce90faa20efc8e71526da.webm?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/430b69b4d92ce90faa20efc8e71526da.mp4?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gain Skill Points after your runs and use them to build your Skill Tree. Unlock various abilities based on your choice. Rebuild your Skill Tree and try different strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UPGRADEABLE HUB</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/c568ba5edd30707507e0eebecf8ddbe9.poster.avif?t=1753739550\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/c568ba5edd30707507e0eebecf8ddbe9.webm?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/c568ba5edd30707507e0eebecf8ddbe9.mp4?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Visit your Town between expeditions to prepare. Upgrade buildings to make your preparations more effective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROCEDURAL MAP</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/fb76289fa688ef7354107a346e0bcf60.poster.avif?t=1753739550\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/fb76289fa688ef7354107a346e0bcf60.webm?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/fb76289fa688ef7354107a346e0bcf60.mp4?t=1753739550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore a procedurally generated map and uncover paths through the fog of war. Shape your journey toward the act\u2019s final encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL VERSION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 250 cards to uncover progressively</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 100 powerful combos to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ events full of various unpredictable encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class with 30+ perks on the Skill Tree customizable before any run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 quotes to power up your journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MADE WITH PASSION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of creatures of ink, paper, and metal, each with clever mechanics to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game co-developed with award-winning board game designer Jamey Stegmaier, the mastermind behind Scythe, Charterstone, and Viticulture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive hand-crafted origami world, where mysterious creatures lurk, brought to life by an unknown force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made for the roguelike deckbuilder obsessives chasing the perfect flow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Early Access and contribute to shaping a great game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924580/extras/e656c4fb546bb61e33bd18c21a77a995.avif?t=1753739550\" data-has-big width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Inkborn Acram Digital is co-financed by the European Funds for Smart Economy 2021\u20132027 under the KPT ScaleUp Booster project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
